file external-research/20260821-152409_the-standfast-read-marks-rooms-and-the-vocabulary-pruning.md the whole read -- thirteen measured readings, five movements answering each concern, ten blind spots, one booked red, and four ordered arcs
recommend check-in (checkpoint) four arcs proposed and nothing seated -- the mark law, the date fold with its resolver, the active-development room and the counsel close, the vocabulary pruning, and the first-hour page each wait on a word, and the resolver is the gate the first fold must not cross without
